od</surname> <given-names>O</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Detection of human immunoglobulins G and M antibodies to Rift Valley fever virus by enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay.</article-title><source>J Clin Microbiol</source> <year>1984</year>;<volume>19</volume>:<fpage>225</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6538206</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R15"><label>15. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Niklasson</surname> <given-names>B</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Grandien</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Peters</surname> <given-names>CJ</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Gargan</surname> <given-names>TP</given-names> <suffix>II</suffix></string-name> <article-title>Detection of Rift Valley fever virus antigen by enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay.</article-title><source>J Clin Microbiol</source> <year>1983</year>;<volume>17</volume>:<fpage>1026</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>31</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6409920</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R16"><label>16. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>LaBeaud</surname> <given-names>AD</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Ochiai</surname> <given-names>Y</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Peters</surname> <given-names>CJ</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Muchiri</surname> <given-names>EM</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>King</surname> <given-names>CH</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Spectrum of Rift Valley fever virus transmission in Kenya: insights from three distinct regions.</article-title><source>Am J Trop Med Hyg</source> <year>2007</year>;<volume>76</volume>:<fpage>795</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>800</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17488893</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R17"><label>17. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Meadors</surname> <given-